    <article class="stop boss" id="s8">
      <div class="node">4</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>利希尔·烬怒</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 4</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>全程常驻<b>灼热邪焰</b>（约 10 万/秒），每 <b>57 秒</b>一轮：+11 秒召邪犬 → +16 秒古尔丹之指 → +21 秒传送门 → +25 秒灾厄浪潮。<b>星界从转好的那轮起隔轮交古尔丹之指</b>，空档轮土元素转好就补，按分工轮断混乱之箭。</div>
        <div class="subhead">一轮技能轴（以开打为 0 秒，每 57 秒循环）</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row step" id="k-cbolt">
            <div class="when">全程穿插</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:474375}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">混乱之箭 / 灼热邪焰</div><div class="s">3 秒高伤混乱读条 · 全程光环每秒约 10 万火焰</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="">风剪</span></div>
            <div class="why">按分工轮断混乱之箭，轮到你就风剪，借风幕压后续灼热邪焰；邪犬尽快顺劈。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step must">
            <div class="when">+16 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:474457}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>古尔丹之指（开始读条）</div><div class="s">5 秒读条 → +21 秒炸 6 码暗影烈焰并刷野生小鬼</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span><span class="or">空档轮</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:198103}}" alt="">土元素</span></div>
            <div class="why">彼此分开 6 码，<b>落地前约 2–3 秒开星界</b>；星界未好交转好的土元素，都没好提前喊治疗。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">+21 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1223204}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">野生小鬼落地</div><div class="s">从古尔丹之指落点涌出 · 齐读 1.5 秒邪火爆裂</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:192058}}" alt="">电能图腾</span></div>
            <div class="why">图腾 2 秒后才晕，预判落点提前插；小鬼已起读先风剪，图腾接后续。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">+25 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1217345}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">灾厄浪潮 → 恶魔传送门</div><div class="s">10 秒读条推出邪火波 · 首领同时开 10 秒 50% 减伤盾</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">读条结束再点门</span></div>
            <div class="why">等读条结束、浪潮逼近再点门穿波，3 秒免疫浪潮初始伤害与火焰易伤。</div>
          </div>
